оисходит в Бразилии XIX столетия, в эпоху баронов и неотменённого ещё рабства. В основе сюжета классический любовный треугольник. Барон Энрике Собрал, владелец имения «Оуро Верде» состоит в браке с Эленой, уних двое юных сыновей - Инасио и Абелардо. Большая тайна семьи Собрал - личность настоящего отца младшего сына Элены - Абелардо. Давняя измена жены - причина столь жестокого отношения барона к супруге. Не в силах лицезреть такие отношения родителей, Инасио уезжает в Рио-де-Жанейро. В городе он влюбляется в хозяйку самого известного борделя - Эстер Деламаре. Их роман прерывается в связи с необходимостью Инасио уехать в имение по причине ухудшения здоровья матери.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"4675","ru":"Christy","en":"Christy","year":"1994","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":10,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oDkG0hve6OfiSjIpVC6hvoCJCjO.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"1989 год. Кристи Рене Солтерс, дочь шахтёра из небольшого города в Западной Виргинии, открывает в себе талант к боксу. Её менеджером и тренером становится Джим Мартин, будущий муж. Кристи одерживает победы и становится олицетворением женского бокса, однако в личной жизни она сталкивается с насилием и издевательствами со стороны мужа.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"73068","ru":"비긴어게인","en":"비긴어게인","year":"2017","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":10,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/auRCHtuXwk4OJdir58NFmWOewsT.jpg","genres":["Реалити-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"292121","ru":"Пугало","en":"허수아비","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sp4Or8RnDb8VNue3ScaftCcVnR9.jpg","genres":["криминал","детектив","драма"],"overview":"Полицейский возвращается в родной город, где происходит серия убийств, и начинает преследовать преступника.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"4957","ru":"陀槍師姐","en":"陀槍師姐","year":"1998","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bwxryiak9cc4hrZypUF4kw81muF.jpg","genres":["комедия","криминал","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"99852","ru":"重案六组","en":"重案六组","year":"2001","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2As5ibsW437Ij7vD2NbItz6byvx.jpg","genres":["драма","детектив","криминал"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"71908","ru":"크라임씬","en":"크라임씬","year":"2014","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9cto9OAYhk43L1OrjcKisviDtTl.jpg","genres":["криминал","Реалити-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"4821","ru":"American Bandstand","en":"American Bandstand","year":"1957","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eSVrrBYvMXOZgLOZC45H2VPc7dl.jpg","genres":["Реалити-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"138291","ru":"Безмятежная переправа","en":"无忧渡","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aOwcGJJveYlHJCVqpqB9FNZhpNm.jpg","genres":["драма","НФ и Фэнтези"],"overview":"В процветающем городе Гуанпин люди и демоны живут в гармонии. Демоны мастерски скрывают свою истинную природу и могут принимать облик людей. Бань Ся, дочь богатой семьи, обладает уникальными глазами, которые позволяют ей видеть тени тех, кто на самом деле не существует. Из-за этого, несмотря на её покладистый и послушный характер, её тайно называют «сумасшедшей». Когда Бань Ся узнаёт, что невестка её кузена — демон, она оказывается в опасности и встречает Сюань Е, охотника на демонов. Нежный поцелуй в глаза, который он ей дарит, открывает Бань Ся новый мир, где люди и демоны сосуществуют.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"75702","ru":"La vida moderna","en":"La vida moderna","year":"2015","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o5otth5x5l4YNfdBYjJnvVv0Z1C.jpg","genres":["комедия","Ток-шоу"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"31985","ru":"笑傲江湖","en":"笑傲江湖","year":"1996","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gBk1tW8UUahnOiQAWqnzNvRjOdD.jpg","genres":["драма","Боевик и Приключения"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"17808","ru":"Never Say Goal","en":"Never Say Goal","year":"1990","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hNgJnanC4sapQ3GCCrR8g2FYdao.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"3801","ru":"Globe Trekker","en":"Globe Trekker","year":"1994","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hMP8XLI1QFqJdeZ6fz78RdWniYE.jpg","genres":["документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"291634","ru":"Крукхейвен","en":"Crookhaven","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9mmJrXEBlLKtR7ccTl4Qnw99fci.jpg","genres":["Боевик и Приключения","драма","детектив"],"overview":"Юные воры учатся использовать свои навыки во благо в тайной школе под руководством Каспиана Локетта. Юный карманник Габриэль Эйвери присоединяется к «Кривой Сети», чтобы бороться с «Безымянными», и открывает своё предназначение.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"261391","ru":"喜剧之王单口季","en":"喜剧之王单口季","year":"2024","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o6XPcUGl2BBo8BEexwnURXJTp4x.jpg","genres":["Реалити-шоу","Ток-шоу","комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"270432","ru":"我在顶峰等你","en":"我在顶峰等你","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tSUKkKWgHpxJr73GOJC9BfKtd0D.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"305135","ru":"Cómplices","en":"Cómplices","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4YvfMycvR5wJf7OHUP5yCM6a8tm.jpg","genres":["комедия","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"306499","ru":"Baddies USA","en":"Baddies USA","year":"2025","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kasC42Bu2pSrLBmGBF8HkndGXwF.jpg","genres":[],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"75501","ru":"ひよっこ","en":"ひよっこ","year":"2017","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/utimgBSieMsvJpIvwzvASF7YSU2.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"3704","ru":"特救指令ソルブレイン","en":"特救指令ソルブレイン","year":"1991","type":"Сериал","rating":8.2,"votes":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/u1rlZgp8Tti7mdXPHNIZ5w7o06I.jpg","genres":["Боевик и Приключения"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":""